mode: "100644"
text: "# Setup, growth, monetization + two worked examples\n\n## Setup checklist (native — the agent advises; the user creates the group)\n```\n[ ] Niche: one specific audience (\"everyone\" is not an audience)\n[ ] Name: keyword-rich + searchable (\"Etsy Sellers Who Want Repeat Buyers\", not \"Our Community\")\n[ ] Privacy: Private (Visible) -- found in search, content members-only (~40% higher engagement)\n[ ] 2-3 membership questions (filter quality + capture email/consent) + admin approval at first\n[ ] Description (what members get + rules) + branded cover + discovery tags\n[ ] Automated welcome message + pinned resource/start-here post\n```\n\n## Engagement calendar (in-group -- post natively / via community-management)\n```\nDaily, varied: educational post / discussion question / POLL (one-click) / short-form video (~3x) / occasional promo.\nFirst 30-60 min: respond to every comment; notify your most engaged members. Saves + shares > likes. Never post-and-ghost.\nNo selling in the first 30 days of a new group.\n```\n\n## Growth playbook (quality, not blasts)\n```\nInvite: email list + social followers (target ~30% acceptance, ~40% 30-day retention).\nPartner: non-competing admins -> co-host events, joint giveaways, shout-outs.\nMagnet: a lead magnet gated behind a membership question or a welcome post.\nAds: you can't advertise INSIDE a group, but you can run ads to the group JOIN LINK.\nCross-post: genuine value in 20-50 related groups (manually) -- NOT bulk-poster automation (ToS/ban) or bought members.\nPace: 200-500 members/month -> ~1,000 in 2-4 months (2-4 weeks with an email list).\n```\n\n## Value-first monetization ladder\n```\nValue (answer questions, free resources) -> Trust (show up daily, know-like-trust) -> Sales (offers/coaching/membership/affiliate).\nWarm niche groups: ~20-23% on direct offers; $3-15K/mo is common. The community is the product; revenue follows. Never fabricate revenue.\n```\n\n## The Page -> Group funnel (what WoopSocial publishes)\n```\nWoopSocial publishes the FACEBOOK PAGE post/Reel (+ IG/other channels) with the group JOIN LINK + a value hook ->\ndrives people to JOIN. WoopSocial does NOT post inside the group (FACEBOOK = the Page; no group target).\n```\n\n## Worked example 1 - course creator (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nASSET: \"Notion for Freelancers\" group, Private(Visible), 3 questions (incl. email opt-in). ENGAGE: daily -- a tip, a poll,\na 30-sec screen-record; I reply in the first hour (community-management runs the moderation). GROW: invite my list +\ngenuine cross-posts; ads to the join link. MONETIZE: no pitch for 30 days, then my template pack. WoopSocial publishes the\nPAGE posts that drive joins; I post inside the group natively. No bulk bots, no bought members.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 - local studio (warm studio voice)\n```\nASSET: \"Rotterdam Home Bakers\" -- niche, Private(Visible), warm rules. ENGAGE: a weekly bake-along poll, member spotlights,\nshort videos; we answer every comment. GROW: invite our newsletter + partner with a non-competing local admin. MONETIZE:\nvalue first -- our workshops come up naturally after trust. WoopSocial publishes the Page + IG posts that funnel joins;\nthe group itself we tend by hand (-> community-management). We watch acceptance + retention, never vanity counts.\n```\n\nBoth: a niche Private-Visible community asset; two-way daily engagement (no ghosting, no day-one selling); quality\ngrowth (no automation/bots); value-first monetization; WoopSocial funnels via the Page while the group stays native.\n"
